    "body": "I faced the kubernetes names length in another context (openshift) and made some first attempt in issue 851. It would probably make sense to take a look at both problems together. Is anyone working on some code in this issue?  If not, maybe I could take a look as I already touched the code, but it would be helpful if sb gave clear examples of critical formats to parse.",
